overfitting ≠ model size
overfitting ≠ memorization by definition
underfitting ≠ small model by definition
inductive bias ≠ cognitive bias
inductive bias ≠ statistical estimator bias
bias–variance tradeoff ≠ universal U-shaped complexity law
training set ≠ all development data
validation set ≠ final test set
test set ≠ repeatedly consulted development data
distribution shift ≠ overfitting
distribution shift ≠ covariate shift only
data leakage ≠ benchmark contamination
